          "value": "<p>Alekin's emotions are starting to spiral out of control as the party confronts him, constantly altering his mood and affecting his abilities.</p><p>After Alekin uses an Emotionally Unstable ability, advance his Emotionally Unstable to the next stage (Happiness -&gt; Sadness -&gt; Fear -&gt; Disgust -&gt; Happiness), which alters the damage type and secondary effects of the next Emotionally Unstable ability he uses.</p><p>The following abilities count as Emotionally Unstable abilities:</p><ul><li><p>Emotional Exposure.</p></li><li><p>Emotional Jab.</p></li><li><p>Emotional Outburst.</p></li><li><p>Emotional Breakdown.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Special:</strong> Using Emotional Jab for Reactive Strike does not advance Emotionally Unstable.</p>"
