          "value": "<p>Alekin channels his emotions into a @Template[cone|distance:30], dealing @Damage[8d6] damage to all enemies with a Basic Save.</p><p><strong>Happiness:</strong></p><p>Emotional Outburst deals Fire damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect]. On a failed save, targets are additionally affected by a 5th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.r8g7oSumKOHDqJsd]{Agitate} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Sadness:</strong></p><p>Emotional Outburst deals Cold damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect]. On a failed save, targets are unable to use Reactions for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Fear:</strong></p><p>Emotional Outburst deals Mental damage with a @Check[will|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect]. On a failed save, targets become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p><p><strong>Disgust:</strong></p><p>Emotional Outburst deals Acid damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect]. On a failed save, targets become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>"
