        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirement</strong> Alekin has at least one Decoy active.</p><hr /><p>Alekin sacrifices all of his Decoys to deal devastating damage to his enemies. Select one body for Alekin to move into, then destroy all other bodies, dealing @Damage[13d6] damage with a Basic Save to all enemies in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15] around any of the destroyed Decoys. On a failed save, targeted creatures are affected by a condition, as listed below.</p><p>Targets standing in more than one emanation are only affected once, but the outcome of their save is considered to be one stage lower than the rolled result.</p><p>Then, Alekin is healed by half of the highest instance of damage dealt (After applying Resistances and Weaknesses).</p><p><strong>Happiness: </strong>Emotional Breakdown deals Fire damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:33|basic|options:damaging-effect].</p><p><strong>Sadness: </strong>Emotional Breakdown deals Cold damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:33|basic|options:damaging-effect].</p><p><strong>Fear: </strong>Emotional Breakdown deals Mental damage with a @Check[will|dc:33|basic|options:damaging-effect].</p><p><strong>Disgust: </strong>Emotional Breakdown deals Acid damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:33|basic|options:damaging-effect].</p>"
        },
