        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>When a Decoy is damaged, it explodes, dealing @Damage[5d8] damage in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15] with a Basic Save.</p><p>The save depends on Alekin's current emotion:</p><p><strong>Happiness:</strong> @Check[reflex|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect].<br /><strong>Sadness:</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect].<br /><strong>Fear:</strong> @Check[will|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect].<br /><strong>Disgust:</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:34|basic|options:damaging-effect].</p><p><em>Note: Effects that destroy a Decoy without damaging it (Like Psychic Vampire, Emotional Breakdown, Grasp of Envy, or any other abilities that can destroy a target without dealing damage) do not trigger Rigged Decoys.</em></p>"
